description.narrative:
Core-support is to be provided to CAPC for 2022-2025 to develop internal capacities to manage results in accordance to internal institutional Strategy; enhance monitoring and reporting skills therefore contributing to the promotion of accountable and professional local CSOs in Moldova. 

As the main purpose of core support is to strengthen local CSOS, it is expected that by the end of the contribution CAPC's team will fully implement the core objectives stated in the institutional Strategy 2022-2025; will implement the System Based Audit Recommendations from 2020 related to internal structural and institutional changes and priorities and will address institutional weaknesses related to human resources and board functioning, financial sustainability, IT security, strategic communication and projects and activities sustainability. 

Sweden will support CAPC in its endeavour to implement the following objectives: 

- Upgraded corruption proofing, monitoring and/or assessment tools, covering civic engagement and women empowerment, capitalized in partnerships with the public and private sector;

- Gender-sensitive whistle-blower reporting, protection and victim-centered assistance in corruption cases provided;

- Strengthened CAPCs organizational, expert, financial capacities, sustainability and visibility.
